<title>SRI LANKA: Tea Smallholder up on growth outlook.</title>
<headline>Tea Smallholder up on growth outlook.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tea Smallholder Factories Ltd rose 5.4 percent, or 1.50 rupees, to 29.50 on small investor buying of 1,400 shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Investors are keen on the scrip because it is expected to do well, with tea prices at record highs this year,&quot; said a broker specialising in retail investors.</p>
<p>The company processes tea bought from small cultivators.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
